		{
			description: [
				"如果你想用宝石强化装备（盔甲、工具、武器），必须先为该装备创建一个插槽才能镶嵌宝石。"
				""
				"&e&l如何制作宝石粉尘？&r&r"
				"嗯，让&b&o铁砧&r&r砸碎一些宝石。这样宝石就会变成粉末！"
				""
				"&e&l如何将宝石镶嵌到插槽中？&r&r"
				"只需将有宝石插槽的物品放在&b&o锻造台&r&r中，并用你想要的宝石进行升级！"
				""
				"&e&l在哪里可以制作宝石插槽？&r&r"
				"为此，你必须将你的装备放入重铸台 (Reforging Table) 中"
				"{image:apotheosis:blocks/reforging/simple_table_top width:30 height:30 align:1}"
				"将装备放入后，你必须添加反刍材料，例如："
				""
				">> &e&l神秘废金属&r &r"
				"{image:apotheosis:items/common_material width:20 height:20 align:1}"
				"&o这个必须在&2&l简易反刍台&r&r&r内使用"
				"{image:apotheosis:blocks/reforging/simple_table_top width:10 height:10 align:1}"
				""
				">> &e&lTimeworn Fabric&r&r"
				"{image:apotheosis:items/uncommon_material width:20 height:20 align:1}"
				"&o这个必须在&2&l简易反刍台&r&r&r内使用"
				"{image:apotheosis:blocks/reforging/simple_table_top width:10 height:10 align:1}"
				""
				">> &e&l发光水晶碎片&r&r"
				"{image:apotheosis:items/rare_material width:20 height:20 align:1}"
				"&o这个必须在&2&l简易反刍台&r&r&r内使用"
				"{image:apotheosis:blocks/reforging/simple_table_top width:10 height:10 align:1}"
				""
				">> &e&l神秘沙砾&r&r"
				"{image:apotheosis:items/epic_material width:20 height:20 align:1}"
				"&o这个必须在&2&l简易反刍台&r&r&r内使用"
				"{image:apotheosis:blocks/reforging/simple_table_top width:10 height:10 align:1}"
				""
				">> &e&l神锻造珍珠&r&r"
				"{image:apotheosis:items/mythic_material width:20 height:20 align:1}"
				"&o这个必须在&2&lRegorging Table&r&r&r中使用"
				"{image:apotheosis:blocks/reforging/table_top width:10 height:10 align:1}"
				""
				""
				"----------------------------"
				">> &d&l光辉精华&r&r"
				"{image:ze_apotheosis:item/radiant_material width:10 height:10 align:1}"
				"&o这个必须在&2&lArtisanal Regorging Table&r&r&r中使用"
				"{image:ze_apotheosis:blocks/reforging/artisanal_table_top width:10 height:10 align:1}"
				""
